  "title": "Easy Sweet Potato Soufflé",
  "description": "This sweet potato souffle made with mashed sweet potatoes is light and fluffy with a crumbly pecan topping—perfect for Thanksgiving.",
  "authors": [
    "Jane Cagle"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-10-06T19:40:56-04:00",
