  "ingredients": [
    "6 sweet potatoes",
    "1 cup white sugar",
    "0.5 cup milk",
    "0.5 cup melted butter",
    "2 eggs, beaten",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "1 cup dark brown sugar",
    "1 cup chopped pecans",
    "0.33333334326744 cup all-purpose flour",
    "0.33333334326744 cup melted butter"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Place sweet potatoes in a large stockpot; cover with 1 inch of water. Bring to a boil over medium heat and cook until fork-tender, about 20 minutes. Drain, cool, and remove skins.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vFfepjJBkNcER-rY-6Fe4ceB3Vg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13756-easy-sweet-potato-souffle-VAT-step-02-4e2755d5d506469fb5987652e15116c7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13756/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease or butter a 2-quart casserole dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/nvJfmcf2acrggYlb-vw-a4wDW4w=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13756-easy-sweet-potato-souffle-VAT-step-03-e78250483e54492d90ccfdf644f90cb8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13756/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place potatoes in a large bowl; beat with an electric mixer on low speed until potatoes begin to break up. Increase speed to medium-high; continue blending until smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/iGBT3u6xsqddR88ZMQYsiXpDH6o=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13756-easy-sweet-potato-souffle-VAT-step-04-b6bc9ed168d14099bbefc52343d2ef73.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13756/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reduce speed to low and add white sugar, milk, 1/2 cup butter, eggs, vanilla extract, and salt; continue mixing until well combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ZzflW5cWQHWX-PIBQeFLAqIMFFA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13756-easy-sweet-potato-souffle-VAT-step-05-fb44d830b7fa40f6b9a75a08034bc8f0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13756/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove and discard any potato fibers on the beaters. Pour mixture into the prepared casserole dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/0ymKu1Bvw8d3BffAFkOlIGvgkug=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13756-easy-sweet-potato-souffle-VAT-step-06-f005d284dc8d4776814a1d0e5b260e1f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13756/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix brown sugar, pecans, flour, and 1/3 cup butter together in a medium bowl until crumbly. Sprinkle topping over potato mixture.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/C2AqawnPZUoEQp4cqBdqnEmfax8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13756-easy-sweet-potato-souffle-VAT-step-07-fa001f37b0e149c9a059fa5f581bb6ed.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13756/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until center of soufflé is set, about 40 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/5ED9dkshFQBZPux5GNdFRZ_F95w=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13756-easy-sweet-potato-souffle-VAT-step-08-f2b9b0f201294b86862fc06f51248267.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13756/step_07.webp"
    }
